	<h6 style="text-align:center;" data-zesty-id="content:text:14:20">Partnership Opportunities</h6>
	<p style="text-align:center;" data-zesty-id="content:textarea:15:38">
	We look forward to discovering opportunities to work with you to engage employees, delight customers, and increase sales — all while doing good for people in need.&nbsp;
</p>
